==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*kensēō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*ḱn̥seh₁-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*ḱn̥seye-||to announce}}.

Cognate with Sanskrit {{m|sa|शंसति||to declare}}, Proto-Iranian {{m|ira-pro|*ĉánhati}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|cēnseō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|cēnseō|cēnsēre|cēnsuī|cēnsum|conj=2}}

# I give an [[opinion]].
# I [[think]], [[suppose]] or [[judge]].
# I [[recommend]].
#: ''Ceterum '''censeo''' Carthaginem esse delendam''
# I [[decree]], [[vote]] or [[determine]].
# I [[count]] or [[reckon]].
# I [[assess]].

